{
  "<size=26>After using skills to ATK foes, gain <link=\"s|177\"><u>[Tenacity]</u></link>. At the start of the turn, if you have $1 stacks of Tenacity, you can enter <link=\"s|178\"><u>[Iron Will]</u></link>.</size>": "",
