  "Pulse Combo Lv.$1": "",
  "Pulse Combo <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal Nuke damage to foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK ($1 hits). From the second hit, prioritze new targets and change damage to $4 for hits on the same target. Also, there is a $3 base chance to inflict a random Elemental Ailment on the target of each hit, prioritizing inflicting ones the target doesn't have. If the target has an Elemental Ailment, activate a <link=\"s|211\"><u>TECHNICAL</u></link> and deal bonus Nuke damage equal to <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> of ATK. There is a $6 fixed chance to inflict <link=\"s|179\"><u>[Radiation]</u></link> on the main target for $7 turns.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The mystery of the universe is elusive, and with a little bit of power you can inflict Ruin nuclear heat damage on all your enemies.</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size=27>Nuclear Resonance Lv.$1</size>": "",
  "<size=27>Nuclear Resonance <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Restore HP to 1 ally equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Makoto's ATK + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>, and increase Makoto's ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> for $4 turns. Also gain $5 <link=\"s|177\"><u>[Tenacity]</u></link> stacks, and gain additional <link=\"s|177\"><u>[Tenacity]</u></link> stacks for each Elemental Ailment on foes.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>As a sturdy shield, it can release an opaque blue light to cover a wounded companion, restoring their life while guarding them.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Nuclear Burst Lv.$1": "",
  "Nuclear Burst <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal Nuke damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. If the target has an Elemental Ailment, activate a <link=\"s\\|211\"><u>TECHNICAL</u></link> and deal bonus Nuke damage equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK. Then gain $3 <link=\"s\\|177\"><u>[Tenacity]</u></link> stacks.\\nWhen <link=\"s|178\"><u>[Iron Will]</u></link> is active, evolve this skill to [Fusion Overload].\\n[Fusion Overload]: Deal Nuke damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> of ATK. For each different Elemental Ailment the target has, activate a <link=\"s|211\"><u>TECHNICAL</u></link> and deal bonus Nuke damage equal to <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> of ATK (up to $6 hits).\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>A sphere of light compresses and explodes under extreme pressure, causing a shock that inflict terrifying nuclear heat damage to the foe, which is increased if the foe has an elemental abnormality.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Gain $1 [Frenzied Voltage] stacks and deal Nuke damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK, then activate the following effects. Spend 1 [Frenzied Voltage] stack to inflict 1 random Elemental Ailment on foes, continuing until foes have 2 Elemental Ailments. Spend all remaining [Frenzied Voltage] stacks to increase this HIGHLIGHT's <link=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by $3 per stack.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Nuke damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "Increase ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> for every Elemental Ailment all foes have.": "",
  "Increase ATK by <color=#0169ca>$1</color> for every Elemental Ailment all foes have.": "",
  "At the start of battle, increase DMG RES by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color>, after entering <link=\"s|178\"><u>[Iron Will]</u></link> each time, additionally increase DMG RES by an additional <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>, up to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color>.": "",
  "At the start of battle, increase DMG RES by <color=#0169ca>$1</color>, after entering <link=\"s|178\"><u>[Iron Will]</u></link> each time, additionally increase DMG RES by an additional <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>, up to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color>.": "",
  "When Makoto enters [Iron Will], extend all foes' Elemental Ailments by $1 turn.\\nWhen [Iron Will] is active, increase Makoto's DMG Bonus by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> and Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color>.": "",
  "When Makoto enters [Iron Will], extend all foes' Elemental Ailments by $1 turn.\\nWhen [Iron Will] is active, increase Makoto's DMG Bonus by <color=#0169ca>$2</color> and Crit DMG by <color=#0169ca>$3</color>.": "",
  "When using [Nuclear Burst] or [Fusion Overload], for every 1 Elemental Ailment type on foes, increase Skill Damage by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> + Makoto's Awareness level * $2.\\nWhen Makoto gains 1 [Tenacity] stack, increase all Nuke allies' ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> + Makoto's Awareness level * $4, Total DMG Amp by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> + Makoto's Awareness level * $6, and Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> + Makoto's Awareness level * $8. Lasts for $9 turns. Stacks up to $10 times.": "",
  "When Makoto gains 1 [Nuclear Burst] or [Fusion Overload], for every 1 Elemental Ailment type on foes, increase Skill Damage by <color=#0169ca>$1</color> + Makoto's Awareness level * $2.\\nWhen Makoto gains 1 [Tenacity] stack, increase all Nuke allies' ATK by <color=#0169ca>$3</color> + Makoto's Awareness level * $4, Total DMG Amp by <color=#0169ca>$5</color> + Makoto's Awareness level * $6, and Crit DMG by <color=#0169ca>$7</color> + Makoto's Awareness level * $8. Lasts for $9 turns. Stacks up to $10 times.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>[Tenacity]</color>": "",
  "Tenacity": "",
  "Increase ATK by $1 and DEF by $2.": "",
