  "Increase ATK by $1 and DEF by $2, evolve [Nuclear Burst] to [Fusion Overload].": "",
  "Aikido · Training": "",
  "When attacking a foe with a {{A}} skill, gain $1 <link=\"s|177\"><u>[Tenacity]</u></link> stack. If <link=\"s|178\"><u>[Iron Will]</u></link> is not active, at the end of turn, gain more <link=\"s|177\"><u>[Tenacity]</u></link> stacks based on the number of Elemental Ailments inflicted on the foe (including foes defeated during the turn). If Makoto has $3 <link=\"s|177\"><u>[Tenacity]</u></link> stacks at the start of her turn, she can activate <link=\"s|178\"><u>[Iron Will]</u></link>, increasing ATK by $4 and DEF by $5 and evolving [Nuclear Burst] to [Fusion Overload] for $6 turns. When <link=\"s|178\"><u>[Iron Will]</u></link> ends, lose all <link=\"s|177\"><u>[Tenacity]</u></link> stacks.": "",
  "Uke · Guard": "",
  "At the start of battle, gain $1 <link=\"s|177\"><u>[Tenacity]</u></link> stacks, Makoto can enter <link=\"s|178\"><u>[Iron Will]</u></link> on turn 1. <link=\"s|178\"><u>[Iron Will]</u></link> additionally increase ATK by $2 and DMG Bonus by $3.": "",
  "Judo · Throw": "",
  "Counter · Attack": "",
  "When entering <link=\"s|178\"><u>[Iron Will]</u></link>, immediately inflict 1 foe with 1 random Elemental Ailment. When <link=\"s|178\"><u>[Iron Will]</u></link> is active, for each different type of Elemental Ailment, increase Makoto's Pierce by $1.": "",
