  "Deal Nuke damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. If the target has an Elemental Ailment, activate a <link=\"s\\|211\"><u>TECHNICAL</u></link> and deal bonus Nuke damage equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK. Then gain $3 <link=\"s\\|177\"><u>[Tenacity]</u></link> stacks.\\nWhen <link=\"s|178\"><u>[Iron Will]</u></link> is active, evolve this skill to [Fusion Overload].\\n[Fusion Overload]: Deal Nuke damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> of ATK. For each different Elemental Ailment the target has, activate a <link=\"s|211\"><u>TECHNICAL</u></link> and deal bonus Nuke damage equal to <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> of ATK (up to $6 hits).": "",
  "Deal Nuke damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. For each different Elemental Ailment the target has, activate a <link=\"s|211\"><u>TECHNICAL</u></link> and deal bonus Nuke damage equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK (up to $3 hits).": "",
  "Gain $1 [Frenzied Voltage] stacks and deal Nuke damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> foe equal to $2 of ATK, then activate the following effects. Spend 1 [Frenzied Voltage] stack to inflict 1 random Elemental Ailment on foes, continuing until foes have 2 Elemental Ailments. Spend all remaining [Frenzied Voltage] stacks to increase this HIGHLIGHT's Skill Damage by $3 per stack.": "",
