  "T<color=#000000>e</color>nacity": "",
  "r:\"^Deal\\\\s+Nuclear\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+foes\\\\s+equal\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Attack\\\\s+\\\\((\\d+)\\\\s+hits\\\\)\\\\.\\\\s*From\\\\s+the\\\\s+second\\\\s+hit,\\\\s+prioritize\\\\s+new\\\\s+targets\\\\s+and\\\\s+change\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)%</color>\\\\s+for\\\\s+hits\\\\s+on\\\\s+the\\\\s+same\\\\s+target\\\\.\\\\s*Also\\\\s+inflict\\\\s+a\\\\s+random\\\\s+elemental\\\\s+ailment\\\\s+on\\\\s+the\\\\s+target\\\\s+of\\\\s+each\\\\s+hit,\\\\s+prioritizing\\\\s+ones\\\\s+the\\\\s+target\\\\s+does\\\\s+not\\\\s+have\\\\.\\\\nIf\\\\s+the\\\\s+target\\\\s+has\\\\s+an\\\\s+elemental\\\\s+ailment,\\\\s+activate\\\\s+a\\\\s+<link\\=\"s\\\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Technical</u></link>\\\\s+and\\\\s+deal\\\\s+bonus\\\\s+Nuclear\\\\s+damage\\\\s+equal\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Attack\\\\.\\\\nInflict\\\\s+<link\\=\"s\\\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Radiation</u></link>\\\\s+on\\\\s+the\\\\s+main\\\\s+target\\\\s+for\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+turns\\\\.\\\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Johanna\\\\s+goes\\\\s+full\\\\s+throttle,\\\\s+dealing\\\\s+Nuclear\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+enemies\\\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Restore\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+ally's\\\\s+HP\\\\s+equal\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Makoto's\\\\s+Attack\\\\s+\\\\+\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\\\.\\\\s*Increase\\\\s+Makoto's\\\\s+Attack\\\\s+by\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+for\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+turns\\\\.\\\\nAlso\\\\s+gain\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+<link\\=\"s\\\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Tenacity</u></link>\\\\s+stacks,\\\\s+and\\\\s+gain\\\\s+more\\\\s+Tenacity\\\\s+stacks\\\\s+for\\\\s+each\\\\s+different\\\\s+elemental\\\\s+ailment\\\\s+on\\\\s+foes\\\\.\\\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Draws\\\\s+on\\\\s+her\\\\s+skills\\\\s+as\\\\s+student\\\\s+council\\\\s+president\\\\s+to\\\\s+support\\\\s+her\\\\s+party,\\\\s+healing\\\\s+allies\\\\s+and\\\\s+strengthening\\\\s+herself\\\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"Deal Nuclear damage to (\\d+) foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> of Attack, and gain (\\d+) <link\\=(.+)><u>Tenacity</u></link> stacks\\.\\nIf the main target has an elemental ailment, activate a <link\\=(.+)><u>Technical</u></link> and deal bonus Nuclear damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> of Attack\\.\\nWhen <link\\=(.+)><u>Crash Out</u></link> is active, evolve this skill to Thermonuclear Fury\\.\\nThermonuclear Fury: Deal Nuclear damage to (\\d+) foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. For each different elemental ailment the target has, activate a <link\\=(.+)><u>Technical</u></link> and deal bonus Nuclear damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> of Attack \\(up to (\\d+) hits\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=(\\d+)><color\\=#850101>(.+)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"^At\\\\s+the\\\\s+start\\\\s+of\\\\s+battle,\\\\s+increase\\\\s+damage\\\\s+reduction\\\\s+rate\\\\s+by\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>,\\\\s+and\\\\s+whenever\\\\s+<link\\=\"s\\\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Crash\\\\s+Out</u></link>\\\\s+is\\\\s+active,\\\\s+increase\\\\s+damage\\\\s+reduction\\\\s+rate\\\\s+by\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+more\\\\s+\\\\(up\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\)\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^During\\\\s+battle,\\\\s+for\\\\s+each\\\\s+different\\\\s+type\\\\s+of\\\\s+elemental\\\\s+ailment\\\\s+on\\\\s+foes,\\\\s+increase\\\\s+Attack\\\\s+by\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Highlight：Deal\\\\s+Nuclear\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+foe\\\\s+equal\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Attack,\\\\s+gain\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+Frenzied\\\\s+Voltage\\\\s+stacks,\\\\s+and\\\\s+activate\\\\s+the\\\\s+following\\\\s+effects\\\\.\\\\nSpend\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+Frenzied\\\\s+Voltage\\\\s+stack\\\\s+to\\\\s+inflict\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+random\\\\s+elemental\\\\s+ailment\\\\s+on\\\\s+foes,\\\\s+continuing\\\\s+until\\\\s+foes\\\\s+have\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+elemental\\\\s+ailments\\\\.\\\\s+Spend\\\\s+all\\\\s+remaining\\\\s+Frenzied\\\\s+Voltage\\\\s+stacks\\\\s+to\\\\s+increase\\\\s+the\\\\s+damage\\\\s+of\\\\s+this\\\\s+skill\\\\s+by\\\\s+(\\\\d+)%\\\\s+per\\\\s+stack\\\\.\\\\n1\\\\s+MORE：Deal\\\\s+Nuclear\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+foe\\\\.\\\\nMelee\\\\s+Attack：Deal\\\\s+Physical\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+foe\\\\.\\\\nRanged\\\\s+Attack：Deal\\\\s+Gun\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+foe\\\\.\\\\s+Can\\\\s+fire\\\\s+until\\\\s+out\\\\s+of\\\\s+ammo\\\\.$\"": "",
  "When attacking a foe with a skill, gain 1 <link\\=\"s|177\"><u>Tenacity</u></link> stack. If <link\\=\"s|178\"><u>Crash Out</u></link> is not active, at the end of the action, gain more Tenacity stacks based on the number of elemental ailments inflicted on foes (including foes defeated during the turn).\\nIf Makoto has 5 Tenacity stacks at the start of her turn, she can activate Crash Out, increasing Attack by 40% and Defense by 20%, and evolving Nuclear Fury to Thermonuclear Fury for 2 turns. When Crash Out ends, lose all Tenacity stacks.": "",
  "At the start of battle, gain 5 <link\\=\"s|177\"><u>Tenacity</u></link> stacks, allowing Makoto to activate <link\\=\"s|178\"><u>Crash Out</u></link>.\\nWhen Crash Out is active, increase Attack by 50% more and damage by 35%.": "",
  "When <link\\=\"s|178\"><u>Crash Out</u></link> is active, inflict random elemental ailments on foes, and for each different type of elemental ailment, increase Makoto's pierce rate by 6%.": "",
  "When entering <link\\=\"s|178\"><u>Crash Out</u></link> state, inflict random elemental ailments on foes, and for each different type of elemental ailment, increase Makoto's pierce rate by 6%.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Sanctioned Drift and Nuclear Fury by 3.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: Increase maximum Frenzied Voltage stacks to 4. Inflict up to 4 elemental ailments on foes, and increase skill damage up to 4 times.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of President's Prowess and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "When <link\\=\"s|178\"><u>Crash Out</u></link> is active, Makoto can gain an extra action. (These extra actions do not affect the duration of effects with turn limits.)\\nAlso decrease the SP cost of Thermonuclear Fury by 33%.": "",
